<title>GERMANY: VEBA DETAILS FIRST-HALF 1997 FIGURES.</title>
<headline>VEBA DETAILS FIRST-HALF 1997 FIGURES.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   816     vs 743</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     1,748   vs 1,632</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit			    1,014   vs 896</p>
<p>    Group sales				  39,707  vs 36,588</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>     Electricity				 8,048   vs 7,767</p>
<p>     Chemicals				   5,559   vs 5,401</p>
<p>     Oil					   9,603   vs 8,413</p>
<p>     Trading, transport, services	  16,348  vs 14,821</p>
<p>     Telecommunications			149     vs 186</p>
<p>    Investments				  2,246   vs 2,089</p>
<p>    No of employees			    124,331 vs 123,391</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified utility group is Veba AG. The payroll numbers at the end of June are compared with the figures at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
